Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:13.54,Defaut,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\b1\c&H0080D0FF&}Mr. Chen{\r}\N{\c&H00E6FF&\b1}Excuse me{\r}, sir. {\c&H00E6FF&\b1}Good morning{\r}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.80,0:00:18.14,Defaut,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\b1\c&H0080D0FF&}Papa Fiston{\r}\N{\c&H00E6FF&\b1}Good morning{\r}, my friend! {\c&H00E6FF&\b1}Welcome{\r}!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.30,0:00:25.81,Defaut,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\b1\c&H0080D0FF&}Mr. Chen{\r}\N{\c&H00E6FF&\b1}Thank you{\r}. I am looking for Zando. {\c&H00E6FF&\b1}Where is{\r} Zando market?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.80,0:00:36.21,Defaut,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\b1\c&H0080D0FF&}Papa Fiston{\r}\NZando? Easy! It is in Limete. Take a bus to Matete. Go straight, then turn right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.30,0:00:43.66,Defaut,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\b1\c&H0080D0FF&}Mr. Chen{\r}\NLimete... a bus to Matete... OK. {\c&H00E6FF&\b1}Is it far{\r}?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.80,0:00:49.79,Defaut,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\b1\c&H0080D0FF&}Papa Fiston{\r}\NNo, no. It is {\c&H00E6FF&\b1}very near{\r}. {\c&H00E6FF&\b1}Twenty minutes{\r}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.80,0:00:59.54,Defaut,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\b1\c&H0080D0FF&}Grace{\r}\N{\c&H00E6FF&\b1}Excuse me{\r}. Sorry, Papa. That is {\c&H00E6FF&\b1}not correct{\r}.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.90,0:01:03.37,Defaut,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\b1\c&H0080D0FF&}Papa Fiston{\r}\N{\c&H00E6FF&\b1}Not correct{\r}? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.30,0:01:10.90,Defaut,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\b1\c&H0080D0FF&}Grace{\r}\NZando is not in Limete. Zando is in Gombe. It is in the {\c&H00E6FF&\b1}city centre{\r}.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.90,0:01:15.21,Defaut,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\b1\c&H0080D0FF&}Mr. Chen{\r}\NIn Gombe? Not in Limete?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.30,0:01:28.13,Defaut,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\b1\c&H0080D0FF&}Grace{\r}\NYes. Gombe. Take a {\c&H00E6FF&\b1}taxi-bus{\r}. The driver says "Zando! Zando!". You get in. It is easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.48,0:01:30.55,Defaut,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\b1\c&H0080D0FF&}Conductor{\r}\NZando! Zando!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.80,0:01:33.34,Defaut,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\b1\c&H0080D0FF&}Mr. Chen{\r}\N{\c&H00E6FF&\b1}How much{\r} is the bus?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.69,0:01:36.93,Defaut,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\b1\c&H0080D0FF&}Grace{\r}\NIt is {\c&H00E6FF&\b1}cheap{\r}. Have {\c&H00E6FF&\b1}small money{\r} with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.30,0:01:45.38,Defaut,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\b1\c&H0080D0FF&}Papa Fiston{\r}\NAh! Sorry, sorry! Limete is a different market. My mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.20,0:01:53.52,Defaut,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\b1\c&H0080D0FF&}Mr. Chen{\r}\NNo problem. {\c&H00E6FF&\b1}Thank you{\r}, sir. And {\c&H00E6FF&\b1}thank you{\r} very much, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.87,0:01:59.39,Defaut,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\b1\c&H0080D0FF&}Grace{\r}\N{\c&H00E6FF&\b1}You're {\c&H00E6FF&\b1}welcome{\r}{\r}. Come, the bus stop is here. {\c&H00E6FF&\b1}Follow me{\r}.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.30,0:02:03.71,Defaut,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\b1\c&H0080D0FF&}Mr. Chen{\r}\NGreat! {\c&H00E6FF&\b1}Goodbye{\r}, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.06,0:02:07.23,Defaut,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\b1\c&H0080D0FF&}Papa Fiston{\r}\N{\c&H00E6FF&\b1}Goodbye{\r}! {\c&H00E6FF&\b1}Welcome{\r} to Kinshasa!
